activate StructureParser #DarkGray
note right : For instance, an opening curly bracket was found

StructureParser --> DepthCounter : AddObject()
activate DepthCounter
DepthCounter --> DepthCounter : AddElement()
DepthCounter --> DepthCounter : CheckLastElement()
alt Last element is a value
DepthCounter --> StructureParser : Error Invalid JSON
else Last element is an opening curly bracket
DepthCounter --> StructureParser : Error Invalid JSON
else
  alt Last element is a key
  DepthCounter --> DepthCounter : Pop key from stack
  end
  DepthCounter --> DepthCounter : Push opening curly bracket onto stack
  DepthCounter --> DepthCounter : Push new counter onto stack
  DepthCounter --> StructureParser
  deactivate DepthCounter
end

StructureParser --> Parser : OnStartObject()

activate Parser #LightGrey
note left : Call to user implementation
...
